# Camera Obscura capability: vulkan-1.3 (ARCHITECTURE.md §4, build-brief task 0.2b).
# Every DRM render node gets its own probe unit. Whether the node has a
# hardware-accelerated Vulkan 1.3 device depends on the graphics driver, so it can't be
# decided here, and Vulkan must not run in a udev worker: the probe runs as a service
# (obscura-cap-vulkan-1.3-probe@.service), which upholds the capability target only if
# the node qualifies. Removal needs no rule: the probe is BindsTo= the device.
ACTION=="remove", GOTO="obscura_cap_vulkan_1_3_end"
SUBSYSTEM!="drm", GOTO="obscura_cap_vulkan_1_3_end"
KERNEL!="renderD[0-9]*", GOTO="obscura_cap_vulkan_1_3_end"
TAG+="systemd", ENV{SYSTEMD_WANTS}+="obscura-cap-vulkan-1.3-probe@%k.service"
LABEL="obscura_cap_vulkan_1_3_end"
